Modern Web Guidance
===================

This folder is a vendored copy of the `skills/modern-web-guidance` folder of the
npm package modern-web-guidance, version 0.0.196 (skill version
2026_10_16-6654652b): https://github.com/GoogleChrome/modern-web-guidance

Copyright the Modern Web Guidance authors. Licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0; see LICENSE in this folder. THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES in this folder is the
package's own list of what it bundles, with those licences.

The Site's own licence, and the web-factory MIT licence, do not extend to this folder.

Changes made to the upstream files:

- SKILL.md runs the tool from this folder, with DISABLE_TELEMETRY=1, instead of
  fetching the latest version with npx, so that a Site stays on the version it pins,
  works without network in a sandbox and sends no usage data. Its section "Using npx
  / pnpx" is replaced by "Running the vendored copy" to match.
- LICENSE and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES are copied in from the package's root, and this
  NOTICE is added.

Every other file is unchanged.
